### 5.3 Loading States (using shadcn Skeleton)

**Leverage existing:** `components/ui/skeleton.tsx`

Create wrapper components for common loading patterns:
```
loading/
├── index.ts
├── loading-card.tsx (uses Skeleton for card placeholders)
